# What Docker never sends into a build of `apps/api` (the worker image, Dockerfile.worker; C8-D10).
# `app/tests/test_worker_image.py` fails if a line below is removed.

# Secrets and local configuration. `Settings` reads a `.env` it finds, so one inside an image would hand a laptop's
# values to a hosted process. `.env.example` is harmless but is not needed either.
.env
.env.*

# The local virtual environment (hundreds of MB, built for the laptop's platform). The image builds its own.
.venv

# The eval harness's captured venue pages and run results: tens of MB each, regenerable, and not used at run time.
agent_worker/model_eval/captured_pages
agent_worker/model_eval/results

# Caches and bytecode.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
